		{"id":"4aac88464efd75d6","x":-560,"y":-240,"width":680,"height":140,"type":"text","text":"a tavern co-owned by [Dagon](https://criticalrole.fandom.com/wiki/Dagon \"Dagon\").\n\nDagon is an older human man with a patchy red-and-brown beard. He has a few scars, but they seem to be more of a result of living in the harsh landscape of Vasselheim than from any battle."}
